1. PERMITTED USES (授权范围):

   a) The contents of kb_source/ may be used for LOCAL retrieval-augmented
      generation (RAG) within this project, on the user's own device.

   b) The contents may be indexed, chunked, embedded, and stored locally
      for the purpose of providing AI-powered answers to the user.

   c) The full kb_source/ directory may be copied for backup purposes only,
      provided that all original attribution ("潘震(公路车教练)") is preserved.

   d) The training encyclopedia content may be displayed, quoted, and
      referenced within the application's user interface and AI responses,
      with proper attribution.

2. PROHIBITED USES (禁止行为):

   a) REDISTRIBUTION: The contents of kb_source/ may NOT be redistributed
      in any form, in whole or in part, in any medium, public or private,
      without prior written permission from 潘震(公路车教练).

   b) DERIVATIVE WORKS: The contents may NOT be modified and republished,
      remixed, transformed, or used as the basis for any new published work.

   c) COMMERCIAL USE: The contents may NOT be used for any commercial
      purpose, including but not limited to: paid training services,
      subscription products, advertising-supported products, or any
      revenue-generating activity.

   d) MISATTRIBUTION: The contents may NOT be republished, rehosted, or
      redistributed under any name other than the original author
      潘震(公路车教练). No one may imply endorsement by 潘震(公路车教练)
      of any derived product or service.

3. REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION (必须署名):

   In every use, display, or reference of the kb_source/ content, the
   following attribution MUST be present and clearly visible:

       训练百科内容来源 / Content Source: 潘震(公路车教练)
       (Road Cycling Coach, China)

   This includes but is not limited to: the application UI, AI-generated
   responses that quote the content, documentation, websites, marketing
   materials, and academic or technical references.

4. NO WARRANTY (无担保):

   THE CONTENTS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,
   EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF
   MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT.
   THE AUTHOR 潘震(公路车教练) SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES,
   OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE USE OF THE CONTENTS.

5. CONTACT (联系方式):

   For licensing inquiries, permissions, or commercial use requests,
   please contact 潘震(公路车教练) directly through this project's
